   665  0c22 20caf1                     JSR C64_CHROUT
   666  0c25 4c2d0c                     JMP @next                       ;  Process next arg.
   667  0c28 a9a4               @under  LDA # $A4                       ; Not string: print underscore
   668  0c2a 20caf1                     JSR C64_CHROUT                  ;  then process next arg.
